  {
    "index": 3,
    "hash": "GYqsxF5Cd9z85dML7T3s4sQ3110=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-13T14:38:41.048Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "`AnalyticsQueryEngine` wraps an `IAnalyticsStore` and is the read entry point. Construction is trivial; the interesting surface is the query object:\n\n```typescript\ntype AnalyticsQuery = {\n  start: DateTime | null;\n  end: DateTime | null;\n  metrics: string[];\n  currency: AnalyticsPath;\n  select: Record<string, AnalyticsPath[]>;\n  granularity: AnalyticsGranularity;\n  lod: Record<string, number | null>;\n};\n```\n\n`select` maps **dimension name \u2192 list of paths to match**, and `lod` maps dimension name \u2192 truncation depth. The two travel together: a path in `select` sets the *specificity* of what is matched, and the `lod` for that dimension sets how deeply results are *grouped*. Mismatch them and you get data that is technically correct and analytically useless.\n\n`execute()` returns an array of `GroupedPeriodResult`:\n\n```typescript\ntype GroupedPeriodResult = {\n  period: string;\n  start: DateTime;\n  end: DateTime;\n  rows: Array<{\n    dimensions: Record<string, AnalyticsDimension>;\n    metric: string;\n    unit: string | null;\n    value: number;\n    sum: number;\n  }>;\n};\n```\n\nOne result per time bucket, one row per unique dimension combination inside that bucket. `value` is the metric for that row in that period; `sum` is the aggregate over the whole period. `unit` is what keeps currencies from being added together \u2014 the engine never sums across units, so USD and EUR stay separate series rather than silently merging.\n\nPractical caution from the recipe layer: the engine can infer a missing `start`/`end` from the data, but it is fragile on degenerate inputs, so pass an explicit window. And every key present in `select` needs a matching `lod` entry.\n\nProvenance: draft `03-Build/04-WorkWithData/_06-Analytics Engine/typescript/index.md`, with the explicit-window and lod-coverage caveats from the Analytics Processor recipe in `05-Lookup/00-Cookbook.md`; types confirmed against `packages/analytics-engine/core/src/` at 6.2.2-dev.45.",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-13T14:38:39.000Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-13T14:38:41.048Z"
    }
  },
